      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "So Samson is signed up to stand on the street in a giant waffle-cone costume, and the clerk almost recognises him from the viral video. Next we return to Arkady and Pasha at the investigator's table; see you then. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Пока!",
      "gap": 0.3
